CM_ BO_ 2499740773 "Message on BATT (internal multi pack CAN bus) for backup speaker handshake";
CM_ SG_ 2499740773 HVESP01_speakerClaimFlag_1 "Active speaker will set this bit to 1.
Rest of the packs will set this value to 0.
Backup speaker will set this bit to 1 in case of _speakerClaimFlag_1
";
CM_ SG_ 2499740773 HVESP01_expectedSpeakerID_1 "Default all the packs will set this value to 1.
Pack 2 shall set this signal to 2 in case of trying to become speaker.  ";
CM_ BO_ 2499740774 "Message on BATT (internal multi pack CAN bus) for backup speaker handshake";
CM_ SG_ 2499740774 HVESP01_speakerClaimFlag_2 "Active speaker will set this bit to 1.
Rest of the packs will set this value to 0.
